## User

All prime numbers up to and including n, in increasing order.

## Type

type
```haskell
primesUpTo :: Int -> [Int]
```

## Term

```haskell
primesUpTo n = go n []
  where
    go n xs
      | n <= 1 = xs
      | otherwise = go (n `div` 2) $ n : xs
```

